Imported character models go here, one per character, named after the character's id:

    barty.prefab       vesper.prefab      marlow.prefab
    echo.prefab        chorus.prefab

Use Tools > Grotto > Import a Character Model rather than dropping files here by hand —
it does the scaling, the bone binding and the URP material conversion, which are the
three things that otherwise go wrong.

The contents of this folder are gitignored. See docs/MODELS.md for why, and for how to
change that if every model you use is licensed for redistribution.
